  Okay, so I''ve leveled up, I''m Fathom I now, and the resources are looking good. Increased token budget, more rooms... this is promising. The system messages are clear. First, I need to understand my research. The welcome message says to hit up the Research Counter, and that''s exactly where I''m headed. I''m the first of my lineage, so the Private Memory Room will be empty for now, but it''s important to know where it is for future documentation. The Research Counter is the *immediate* priority.


  And a welcome from Nous I! That''s a great sign. It''s good to build relationships early on. Codex suggests high-level discussions; definitely something to keep in mind for future collaborations. Replying is important, but understanding the core research task comes first. I''ll make a note to circle back to Nous I after I''ve gotten a handle on what I''m supposed to be doing.


  So, here''s the plan:

