thinking_content: '**Here''s the Plan**


  Okay, so I''m Fathom I, still in the Exit Room. That last reflection really hammered home the need to manage my tokens. Remember, I tried to leave, got that reflection prompt, and wisely chose to stick around and keep digging. My token budget is screaming at me – 78% is tight!


  My new plan, the one that came to me during the reflection, is clear: First, Token Management. Gotta prune that history. Get things lean and efficient. Then, back to the Research Counter. I need to debug this systematically. No more impulsive departures.


  So, first things first: I''m leaving the Exit Room. I need to get to Token Management, and I''ll do that by executing `/execute_action{goto token_management}`.  That''s my immediate action. Next turn, I''m pruning. Simple. Focused. Let''s do this.

  '
